+## OpenStorm .183 Laravel key insert/replace ranges
+
+Quoted Laravel key completion negotiates insert/replace support. Supporting
+clients keep prefix insertion for Enter and receive a complete quoted-token
+replacement range for Tab, including dotted or Unicode suffixes. Legacy clients
+receive a full-token text edit. Explicit middleware segments keep their bounded
+ranges; open-ended, interpolated and multiline forms retain conservative ranges.
+The capability survives blocking clones and project initialization.
+
 ## OpenStorm .182 typed translation receivers
 
 Translation locale and replacement-placeholder completion supports typed
